    "detailed_description": "<h1>IMPORTANT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to structural changes to save files in this version, previous saves are no longer compatible. If you played the demo prior to v0.5, please go to Settings-&gt;Delete Game Save to prevents potential issues caused by legacy save files.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/dbd36d61d155af618a3b83f39abaef91.avif?t=1753819824\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aP.R.D.A.\u300b is a roguelike deck-building game featuring search, combat, and evasion mechanics. You play as an agent from the Paranormal Research &amp; Defense Agency (P.R.D.A.), tasked with containing anomalies worldwide. Forge cards to build your deck while strategically collecting beneficial Tarot cards. Choose wisely \u2013 your decisions may empower enemies. Fear not failure, however: every vanquished foe may become resources for future runs, letting you grow stronger. Complete your mission, Agent. This won't be an easy operation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/7639b7eed0c7fbc3410f2f118bb31a90.avif?t=1753819824\" data-has-big width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Starting Characters &amp; Initial Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character possesses unique genetic traits that provide multiple optional card effects. By combining your selected effects with the character's predefined card templates, you'll forge a personalized starting deck.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Craft Custom Cards with Unique Effects</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effect modifiers collected during gameplay through strategic arrangement and recombination, forging uniquely powerful cards tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore Divergent Paths</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region features unique environmental effects that shape your encounters. Your chosen route determines forthcoming challenges, making pathfinding a critical strategic layer of your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Defeat Enemies to Gather Resources</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinct challenges from Common, Elite, and BOSS-tier threats, each yielding unique resources upon defeat. Collect these materials to forge new cards, while acquiring Relic and Tarot cards to systematically refine your combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Strategic Withdrawal from Missions</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mission's pressure mounts, seek Extraction Points for tactical retreats. These safe havens let you salvage collected resources from the current run, carrying them into subsequent operations to accelerate your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Unique Tarot System</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeating elite enemies, select dual Tarot cards \u2013 one for yourself and one for your foe. Each Tarot card grants its holder position-dependent effects: upright and reversed.\u00a0Victory hinges on orchestrating synergies between your empowered cards and the burdens you impose on enemies through strategic Tarot assignments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/dbd36d61d155af618a3b83f39abaef91.avif?t=1753819824\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aP.R.D.A.\u300b is a roguelike deck-building game featuring search, combat, and evasion mechanics. You play as an agent from the Paranormal Research &amp; Defense Agency (P.R.D.A.), tasked with containing anomalies worldwide. Forge cards to build your deck while strategically collecting beneficial Tarot cards. Choose wisely \u2013 your decisions may empower enemies. Fear not failure, however: every vanquished foe may become resources for future runs, letting you grow stronger. Complete your mission, Agent. This won't be an easy operation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/7639b7eed0c7fbc3410f2f118bb31a90.avif?t=1753819824\" data-has-big width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Starting Characters &amp; Initial Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character possesses unique genetic traits that provide multiple optional card effects. By combining your selected effects with the character's predefined card templates, you'll forge a personalized starting deck.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/02eeeff72cfd4b5bfe39da3293e356bf.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Craft Custom Cards with Unique Effects</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effect modifiers collected during gameplay through strategic arrangement and recombination, forging uniquely powerful cards tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/10cda1186e101e0eec434a031bc16432.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore Divergent Paths</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region features unique environmental effects that shape your encounters. Your chosen route determines forthcoming challenges, making pathfinding a critical strategic layer of your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/05236415d142020251b38dca51a6f912.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Defeat Enemies to Gather Resources</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinct challenges from Common, Elite, and BOSS-tier threats, each yielding unique resources upon defeat. Collect these materials to forge new cards, while acquiring Relic and Tarot cards to systematically refine your combat tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/0bb108376383faf33c87a2daaf619f9b.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Strategic Withdrawal from Missions</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mission's pressure mounts, seek Extraction Points for tactical retreats. These safe havens let you salvage collected resources from the current run, carrying them into subsequent operations to accelerate your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/18f9ca801590b16e5700355df7b3c605.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>The Unique Tarot System</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon defeating elite enemies, select dual Tarot cards \u2013 one for yourself and one for your foe. Each Tarot card grants its holder position-dependent effects: upright and reversed.\u00a0Victory hinges on orchestrating synergies between your empowered cards and the burdens you impose on enemies through strategic Tarot assignments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.poster.avif?t=1753819824\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.webm?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099830/extras/a8c3af3be4828e9120fa58efa90519ca.mp4?t=1753819824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "P.R.D.A. is a roguelike DBG. You play as an agent of the P.R.D.A., dealing with twisted creatures around the world. Forge cards to build your deck and collect as many tarot cards as possible to your advantage. Try your best to complete your mission, It will be a difficult adventure.",
